<title>USA: Comsat Sept 30 Q3 shr rises to $0.10.</title>
<headline>Comsat Sept 30 Q3 shr rises to $0.10.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr    profit   $0.10	   loss   $0.33</p>
<p> Net    profit   5,000	   loss   15,600</p>
<p> Revs   profit   229,800	 profit 203,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  49,100		   47,500</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    profit   $0.41	   profit $0.44</p>
<p> Net    profit   20,100	  profit 21,000</p>
<p> Revs   profit   707,800	 profit 622,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  49,000		   47,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) Full company name is Comsat Corp.</p>
<p>NOTE: The third quarter and first nine months of 1995 included a $20 million pre-tax restructuring charge and third quarter 1996 results included $7.8 million in royalties pre-tax from a licensing agreement that resolved patent infringment disputes with some television encryption equipment manufacturers.</p>
</text>
